1
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:07,695
Now I've taken weakness as my ally

2
00:00:07,696 --> 00:00:11,347
I can fly to the highest heights

3
00:00:11,347 --> 00:00:14,130
If I would just stop here

4
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:18,782
all I've lost would lose its luster

5
00:00:18,782 --> 00:00:22,304
If you were lost out somewhere

6
00:00:22,304 --> 00:00:25,912
at the same time my heart is shaken

7
00:00:25,913 --> 00:00:28,782
Id have no way to find you

8
00:00:28,782 --> 00:00:32,826
your kindness, or even your strength

9
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:38,521
I know

10
00:00:38,521 --> 00:00:40,391
It's time for the dawn!

11
00:00:40,478 --> 00:00:43,782
My peak performance

12
00:00:43,869 --> 00:00:47,826
blow straight past in a blast, yeah

13
00:00:47,826 --> 00:00:50,608
You'll be left frozen with laughs

14
00:00:50,608 --> 00:00:55,043
The days of pain left in the past, let's hope

15
00:00:55,043 --> 00:00:57,869
As I make foes of the world

16
00:00:57,869 --> 00:01:02,304
I'm bracing myself upon shaking legs, yeah

17
00:01:02,304 --> 00:01:05,043
Just keep me going for a few more steps

18
00:01:05,043 --> 00:01:09,912
Now, this is the comeback, the time to awaken is now

19
00:01:19,521 --> 00:01:24,478
Now, this is the comeback, the time to awaken is now

20
00:01:30,739 --> 00:01:32,130
Halt, Luffy!

21
00:01:32,130 --> 00:01:34,478
I know ya got this, Momo!

22
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,739
"Get Onigashima out of your way"?

23
00:01:36,739 --> 00:01:38,391
I...

24
00:01:38,478 --> 00:01:40,435
I cannot do it!

25
00:01:48,217 --> 00:01:49,913
Time to finish this!

26
00:01:56,826 --> 00:01:58,999
I hear you, loud and clear.

27
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,826
And I accept!

28
00:02:06,869 --> 00:02:09,043
That burns!

29
00:02:10,696 --> 00:02:12,391
That's right.

30
00:02:12,391 --> 00:02:16,130
You can let go of me.
'Cause I'm not going anywhere.

31
00:02:23,869 --> 00:02:26,652
Tell me, Straw Hat... Did you know?

32
00:02:27,478 --> 00:02:29,435
That twenty years ago...

33
00:02:29,869 --> 00:02:33,869
...the hero of this country
burned to death?

34
00:02:34,608 --> 00:02:38,391
The Land of Wano has been
lawless ever since!

35
00:02:38,391 --> 00:02:42,652
And now, you are the heroes
the people have waited twenty years for!

36
00:03:00,565 --> 00:03:03,086
Flame Dragon Torch!

37
00:03:06,391 --> 00:03:12,086
That hand of yours will never touch me!

38
00:03:12,086 --> 00:03:14,521
It will melt into nothing!

39
00:03:36,608 --> 00:03:37,651
Luffy!

40
00:03:38,739 --> 00:03:40,478
Meltin'...

41
00:03:40,478 --> 00:03:43,260
Yeah, as if!

42
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:47,173
The old guy taught me how to
attack without touchin' ya!

43
00:03:48,782 --> 00:03:54,521
You call it "Haki,"
but we in the Land of Wano call it "Ryuo."

44
00:03:56,086 --> 00:03:57,825
Don't strain yourself, now!

45
00:03:57,869 --> 00:04:02,043
Flow the Haki from the parts of your body
that don't need it into your fists.

46
00:04:02,957 --> 00:04:06,696
I'm smashin' ya down all the way
to the bottom of hell!

47
00:04:06,869 --> 00:04:09,260
Gum-Gum...

48
00:04:09,347 --> 00:04:12,521
Rising Dragon!

49
00:04:14,217 --> 00:04:16,782
Bajrang...

50
00:04:17,478 --> 00:04:20,869
...Gun!

51
00:04:22,174 --> 00:04:24,826
Flame Bagua!

52
00:05:02,521 --> 00:05:05,391
Huh? What's happening?!

53
00:05:07,869 --> 00:05:09,304
What's going on up there?!

54
00:05:09,696 --> 00:05:11,739
Straw Hat-san!

55
00:05:11,826 --> 00:05:13,000
Go!

56
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,304
Please, Straw Hat-san!

57
00:05:15,304 --> 00:05:17,434
Go, Straw Hat!

58
00:05:17,478 --> 00:05:18,521
Please!

59
00:05:18,521 --> 00:05:20,043
Take him down!

60
00:05:20,043 --> 00:05:21,129
Please!

61
00:05:21,174 --> 00:05:22,304
Do it!

62
00:05:22,304 --> 00:05:23,390
We're begging you!

63
00:05:23,391 --> 00:05:25,739
I'm begging you! Please!

64
00:05:25,739 --> 00:05:28,826
I leave the rest to
the lot of ye!

65
00:05:33,217 --> 00:05:36,130
Run! To Kuri!

66
00:05:44,913 --> 00:05:47,739
Oden... sama!

67
00:05:47,739 --> 00:05:49,304
Do not look back!

68
00:05:49,304 --> 00:05:51,434
Run!

69
00:05:54,086 --> 00:05:58,086
There is only one place
those filthy samurai could have gone!

70
00:05:58,086 --> 00:05:59,434
To Kuri!

71
00:05:59,435 --> 00:06:02,565
The heir of Kozuki is in the castle!

72
00:06:02,608 --> 00:06:06,651
Kill them all!
Wipe the name Kozuki from history!

73
00:06:06,652 --> 00:06:07,869
Slaughter them!

74
00:06:07,869 --> 00:06:09,826
Every last one!

75
00:06:10,957 --> 00:06:12,696
He has a child?

76
00:06:12,696 --> 00:06:15,478
I'll put an end to this.

77
00:06:19,826 --> 00:06:21,130
Stop!

78
00:06:21,130 --> 00:06:23,521
Haven't you done enough to the Kozu

79
00:06:26,217 --> 00:06:27,434
Out of my way!

80
00:06:29,260 --> 00:06:33,304
You have my permission to fire
at anyone who dares defy the Shogun!

81
00:06:37,739 --> 00:06:41,739
Let them feel the depths of
the Kurozumi's hatred!

82
00:06:43,130 --> 00:06:44,652
Take this!

83
00:06:50,435 --> 00:06:52,782
Suffer!

84
00:06:52,826 --> 00:06:56,086
Filthy commoners, worshipping
the very ground the Kozuki stand on!

85
00:06:57,739 --> 00:07:00,261
What of Oden's wife?

86
00:07:00,347 --> 00:07:03,390
She was confirmed dead in Bakura Town.

87
00:07:03,435 --> 00:07:06,826
No one else escaped from Oden Castle.

88
00:07:16,696 --> 00:07:20,000
The Kozuki Clan has been
thoroughly wiped out!

89
00:07:20,521 --> 00:07:23,478
Now I present you
with a choice, Daimyo!

90
00:07:24,174 --> 00:07:28,304
Do you choose to stand alongside us
and bring Wano to greatness...

91
00:07:28,304 --> 00:07:30,434
or do you choose war?!

92
00:07:30,435 --> 00:07:32,565
Why even ask...

93
00:07:33,608 --> 00:07:35,782
...when the answer is so obvious?!

94
00:07:35,782 --> 00:07:38,782
The Kozuki Clan is our only Shogun!

95
00:07:42,826 --> 00:07:46,130
Avenge Oden!

96
00:07:46,696 --> 00:07:50,043
Protect the Land of Wano
till you breathe your last!

97
00:07:50,043 --> 00:07:53,651
Fear no enemy! Stand and fight!

98
00:08:06,130 --> 00:08:08,087
Blast Breath!

99
00:08:09,391 --> 00:08:12,044
No!

100
00:08:22,391 --> 00:08:24,739
How utterly pitiful!

101
00:08:24,739 --> 00:08:26,826
"The resolve of the samurai"?

102
00:08:26,826 --> 00:08:30,217
Does the word "samurai"
no longer hold any meaning?

103
00:08:30,217 --> 00:08:32,565
Pathetic, weak samurai!

104
00:08:32,565 --> 00:08:38,173
You have mocked me, looked down on me,
and now you lay defeated before me!

105
00:08:38,174 --> 00:08:41,521
Weaklings cannot protect anything!

106
00:08:46,652 --> 00:08:49,696
Now heed my words, fools!

107
00:08:50,347 --> 00:08:54,651
As of today,
Kurozumi is the law of the land!

108
00:08:54,739 --> 00:08:56,087
Serves you right!

109
00:08:56,652 --> 00:09:00,739
Serves you right!

110
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:11,609
Bring me every man of working age!

111
00:09:13,217 --> 00:09:15,043
Daddy!

112
00:09:15,043 --> 00:09:16,956
Give me back my Daddy!

113
00:09:16,957 --> 00:09:18,913
Don't take him away!

114
00:09:19,957 --> 00:09:21,478
D-Don't shoot!

115
00:09:21,478 --> 00:09:22,782
Honey!

116
00:09:22,782 --> 00:09:24,173
I-I'm okay....

117
00:09:24,521 --> 00:09:27,695
Daddy!

118
00:09:27,696 --> 00:09:30,304
The whole country will be
a weapons factory!

119
00:09:30,304 --> 00:09:32,477
Quit nappin' on the job.

120
00:09:33,174 --> 00:09:36,217
Work till you drop dead!

121
00:09:43,913 --> 00:09:49,391
We can't grow any food...
with soil like this!

122
00:09:54,565 --> 00:09:57,043
I can't take it anymore...

123
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:16,782
I'm sorry...

124
00:10:16,782 --> 00:10:20,086
We have no water to drink... No food...

125
00:10:23,435 --> 00:10:25,695
What will become of this country?

126
00:10:25,696 --> 00:10:29,130
Somebody, help! Please!

127
00:10:29,130 --> 00:10:31,174
Won't somebody save us?!

128
00:10:33,304 --> 00:10:36,347
If you wanna see tomorrow,
then get to work, miserable vermin!

129
00:10:36,347 --> 00:10:41,130
That material's way more important than you!
You break it, you die!

130
00:10:42,347 --> 00:10:44,608
Go ahead and scream if you want!

131
00:10:44,608 --> 00:10:47,173
But no help's coming!

132
00:10:47,174 --> 00:10:50,782
This country's closed off from the world!

133
00:10:52,347 --> 00:10:54,434
I can't take it anymore.

134
00:10:54,913 --> 00:10:57,696
I'd rather die...

135
00:10:58,304 --> 00:10:59,651
Don't jump the gun.

136
00:11:00,260 --> 00:11:02,043
Winter's coming...

137
00:11:02,565 --> 00:11:04,521
A long, long winter...

138
00:11:05,608 --> 00:11:07,217
Believe...

139
00:11:07,217 --> 00:11:09,217
...what Toki-sama said.

140
00:11:27,043 --> 00:11:28,825
Look at them, Kaido!

141
00:11:28,826 --> 00:11:33,304
The lowlives actually ate
the defective Smiles!

142
00:11:34,174 --> 00:11:36,695
Eat! Eat!

143
00:11:36,696 --> 00:11:38,652
Laugh!

144
00:11:38,652 --> 00:11:41,521
And follow in Ebisu Town's footsteps!

145
00:11:41,521 --> 00:11:46,043
Laugh like imbeciles, even if you're starving!
Even if your family dies before your eyes!

146
00:11:47,913 --> 00:11:52,347
It is a fitting life for
maggots such as yourselves!

147
00:11:52,347 --> 00:11:57,782
I'll grace you with a life of
never-ending smiles!

148
00:12:02,043 --> 00:12:04,390
Time for a feast!

149
00:12:07,782 --> 00:12:10,217
Eat and drink...

150
00:12:10,217 --> 00:12:13,347
...to your hearts' content!

151
00:12:17,043 --> 00:12:21,347
My Mommy and Daddy are dead!

152
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:40,043
Komurasaki!

153
00:12:40,043 --> 00:12:44,956
Everything was going my way!
Everything!

154
00:12:45,347 --> 00:12:48,956
You're a lowly tramp who
willingly offered herself up at the Pleasure Hall!

155
00:12:50,696 --> 00:12:53,347
Komurasaki!

156
00:12:53,347 --> 00:12:57,130
You're coming with me to Hell!

157
00:12:57,174 --> 00:13:00,217
And there, we will share
another drink, you and I!

158
00:13:00,435 --> 00:13:04,391
Do not underestimate
the grudge of the Kurozumi Clan!

159
00:13:10,913 --> 00:13:15,739
Foxfire Kin'emon
and the Red Scabbards...

160
00:13:17,391 --> 00:13:20,260
I welcome their challenge,
should we ever stand face to face!

161
00:13:20,260 --> 00:13:23,564
I shall slay them all
in one swift stroke!

162
00:13:25,652 --> 00:13:27,565
Alas, such a dreadful sight.

163
00:14:09,782 --> 00:14:09,912
from this
hell.

164
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,391
"Get Onigashima out of your way"?

165
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,478
What should I do?

166
00:14:26,086 --> 00:14:27,521
It is simply...

167
00:14:28,347 --> 00:14:30,434
...not possible for me!

168
00:14:30,435 --> 00:14:32,304
I cannot!

169
00:14:32,304 --> 00:14:35,521
I have tried so many times,
but it is simply not possible!

170
00:14:35,521 --> 00:14:37,043
Mononosuke

171
00:14:40,565 --> 00:14:42,173
Mononosuke

172
00:14:42,174 --> 00:14:44,608
You are to leap
twenty years into the future,

173
00:14:45,391 --> 00:14:48,130
and return the Kozuki Clan
to greatness!

174
00:14:48,130 --> 00:14:49,652
Mother!

175
00:14:50,521 --> 00:14:53,999
Worry not. I know you can do it.

176
00:14:54,565 --> 00:14:59,260
And all shall know just how much
you have sacrificed for them.

177
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:00,651
Hiyori!

178
00:15:00,739 --> 00:15:02,260
Father!

179
00:15:02,260 --> 00:15:04,043
I leave the rest to you!

180
00:15:09,608 --> 00:15:12,043
If I falter here...

181
00:15:12,086 --> 00:15:15,825
will disgrace the Kozuki name!

182
00:15:15,826 --> 00:15:17,130
Momonosuke-kun!

183
00:15:21,217 --> 00:15:23,695
They all depend on me!

184
00:15:23,739 --> 00:15:26,913
I refuse to surrender!

185
00:15:30,174 --> 00:15:32,043
There! There they are!

186
00:15:33,217 --> 00:15:34,826
Kin'emon! Kiku!

187
00:15:35,217 --> 00:15:36,391
You're still alive, right?!

188
00:15:36,391 --> 00:15:38,913
Don't you die on me!

189
00:15:38,913 --> 00:15:41,739
You hear that?!
Don't you dare die on me!

190
00:15:43,565 --> 00:15:45,304
Please, Straw Hat...

191
00:15:45,304 --> 00:15:47,651
Take down Kaido!

192
00:15:47,652 --> 00:15:57,217
As long as Kaido falls...

193
00:15:58,130 --> 00:15:59,652
Please...

194
00:15:59,652 --> 00:16:01,522
Straw Hat Man...

195
00:16:02,043 --> 00:16:06,347
Our 20-year battle...

196
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:12,130
Kaido must be brought down...
As long as Kaido remains...

197
00:16:12,869 --> 00:16:15,086
...our battle will never be over!

198
00:16:29,217 --> 00:16:31,174
You've done well...

199
00:16:45,478 --> 00:16:48,391
Done well, fighting to get this far!

200
00:16:48,478 --> 00:16:49,261
But...

201
00:16:54,174 --> 00:16:57,782
...you can't change the world!

202
00:17:03,043 --> 00:17:06,043
I plundered everything
with my own two hands...

203
00:17:07,869 --> 00:17:10,826
...and rose to be an Emperor of the Sea.

204
00:17:16,130 --> 00:17:18,347
You're the man, Kaido!

205
00:17:18,347 --> 00:17:20,477
You're making us even stronger!

206
00:17:23,826 --> 00:17:26,912
No one in this world...

207
00:17:26,913 --> 00:17:29,087
...can beat me!

208
00:17:34,217 --> 00:17:37,260
You don't know anything, do you?

209
00:17:38,086 --> 00:17:41,434
Our country can't just stop going to war...

210
00:17:41,957 --> 00:17:46,174
We have to win and loot valuables
so we can pay the Heavenly Tribute...

211
00:17:46,174 --> 00:17:50,130
Otherwise, the world'll strip
our human rights away!

212
00:17:51,608 --> 00:17:55,086
To this country,
we're nothing but tools!

213
00:17:55,739 --> 00:18:00,304
Why does everyone bow down
to those "Celestial Dragons"?

214
00:18:07,565 --> 00:18:09,434
You have been drafted.

215
00:18:09,435 --> 00:18:11,521
And you will join the Navy!

216
00:18:12,739 --> 00:18:15,130
Why should I want to be
the Government's lapdog?!

217
00:18:15,130 --> 00:18:18,174
You're more than
my country can handle.

218
00:18:18,174 --> 00:18:21,130
Shut up! Don't tell me what to do!

219
00:18:21,130 --> 00:18:23,391
Don't mess with me!

220
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:26,217
You're all gonna pay!

221
00:18:28,347 --> 00:18:30,347
If you turn Kaido over to us,

222
00:18:32,913 --> 00:18:37,000
your country will be granted
the right to participate in the Reverie...

223
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:40,739
I am not your bargaining chip!

224
00:18:57,696 --> 00:18:59,696
Kaido escaped!

225
00:19:00,304 --> 00:19:02,043
He got out again?!

226
00:19:02,043 --> 00:19:03,521
That rat bastard!

227
00:19:03,521 --> 00:19:06,304
He gets caught every time he gets hungry!

228
00:19:07,260 --> 00:19:10,260
Our prison ship isn't one big galley!

229
00:19:19,043 --> 00:19:20,390
So strong!

230
00:19:20,391 --> 00:19:22,391
Who is he?!

231
00:19:22,391 --> 00:19:25,521
Hey! This says he's still fifteen!

232
00:19:26,521 --> 00:19:28,912
This bounty's
way too high for a kid!

233
00:19:28,913 --> 00:19:30,783
He's a monster!

234
00:19:32,435 --> 00:19:34,304
Hey, stinkin' brat.

235
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:37,696
Wanna be a pirate?

236
00:19:39,565 --> 00:19:42,043
Rocks said he wanted to see you.

237
00:19:42,043 --> 00:19:43,651
How 'bout it?

238
00:19:47,739 --> 00:19:51,260
Kaido joined the Rocks Pirates!

239
00:19:51,260 --> 00:19:53,912
They're invincible now!

240
00:19:55,913 --> 00:19:58,435
Big trouble, Kaido!

241
00:19:58,435 --> 00:20:01,739
C'mon! We're headed to God Valley!

242
00:20:02,913 --> 00:20:04,565
What?!

243
00:20:04,608 --> 00:20:07,782
The Rocks Pirates split up?!

244
00:20:07,782 --> 00:20:12,999
What kind of joke is that?!
They had all those monsters!

245
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:15,826
I heard some Navy sailor
named Garp defeated them!

246
00:20:15,869 --> 00:20:21,086
They must've had a falling out!
They had no idea how to work as a team!

247
00:20:21,086 --> 00:20:23,738
Where the hell'd you go, Kaido?!

248
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:28,043
You dare spit in my face, you freak!!

249
00:20:32,696 --> 00:20:34,913
It's been ten years since that incident...

250
00:20:35,913 --> 00:20:39,783
You're the avatar of military might, Kaido!

251
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,522
Throughout human history,

252
00:20:43,957 --> 00:20:48,043
resorting to armed conflict has solved
all sorts of problems around the world.

253
00:20:49,478 --> 00:20:51,782
Hardly a surprise...

254
00:20:51,869 --> 00:20:53,999
...because humans are animals!

255
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:57,130
It's only natural for the weak
to fall victim to the strong!

256
00:20:57,130 --> 00:20:58,956
You're totally right.

257
00:20:58,957 --> 00:21:03,739
The remnants of the Rocks Pirates
will come into power!

258
00:21:03,739 --> 00:21:06,391
Weapons are what speak loudest
in the world we live in!

259
00:21:06,391 --> 00:21:09,521
I got something good for you...

260
00:21:12,869 --> 00:21:15,565
Those pampered authorities,
who have only ever known peace...

261
00:21:16,043 --> 00:21:18,738
...were merely lucky enough
to be born as nobles!

262
00:21:19,174 --> 00:21:23,174
Drag them off their thrones,
down to the battlefield!

263
00:21:28,043 --> 00:21:31,086
That's what I call equality and freedom!

264
00:21:31,086 --> 00:21:35,695
A person's worth
is determined only by war!

265
00:21:40,478 --> 00:21:44,087
Ya know I'm gonna win!

266
00:22:00,652 --> 00:22:03,130
I don't know where he heard it from,

267
00:22:03,478 --> 00:22:06,043
but Yamato mentioned Joyboy's name.

268
00:22:07,521 --> 00:22:13,086
Apparently, Oden wanted to welcome Joyboy,
and that's why he called for the borders to open.

269
00:22:13,086 --> 00:22:17,738
If he's the same guy
you're waiting for, King,

270
00:22:18,174 --> 00:22:22,391
then I know exactly who Joyboy is.

271
00:22:46,913 --> 00:22:49,217
Do not lose heart, Momonosuke!

272
00:22:49,869 --> 00:22:52,086
He will win! Luffy will win!

273
00:22:53,043 --> 00:22:54,434
Yes, indeed!

274
00:22:54,739 --> 00:22:58,869
The people of Wano all depend on you!

275
00:22:58,869 --> 00:23:02,869
Do it, Momonosuke-kun!

276
00:23:04,608 --> 00:23:06,782
Come forth, Flame Clouds!

277
00:23:06,782 --> 00:23:09,826
Heed my call!

278
00:23:22,304 --> 00:23:23,738
The hell's that noise?

279
00:23:26,347 --> 00:23:28,390
Robin-san...!

280
00:23:31,739 --> 00:23:34,696
Quell this inferno!

281
00:23:39,869 --> 00:23:41,782
Help!

282
00:23:45,957 --> 00:23:47,739
Save them all!

283
00:23:47,739 --> 00:23:49,869
Water of Zou!

284
00:24:02,739 --> 00:24:04,086
Water?!

285
00:24:04,086 --> 00:24:06,738
They's fallin' like raindrops!

286
00:24:06,739 --> 00:24:08,347
Look! Isn't that...?!

287
00:24:08,347 --> 00:24:11,782
We will make it outta here!

288
00:24:11,869 --> 00:24:12,782
Usopp?!

289
00:24:12,782 --> 00:24:13,739
Kin'emon!

290
00:24:13,739 --> 00:24:15,261
O-Kiku-chan!

291
00:24:15,696 --> 00:24:17,087
Noooo!

292
00:24:29,739 --> 00:24:30,913
You have been...

293
00:24:31,869 --> 00:24:33,912
You have been so brave and strong....

294
00:24:36,347 --> 00:24:39,304
...for all these years,

295
00:24:39,304 --> 00:24:40,521
Hiyori-sama.

296
00:24:45,304 --> 00:24:47,260
Sorry 'bout that, Zoro...

297
00:24:47,304 --> 00:24:50,956
Hey, don't y'all get washed off, now!

298
00:24:52,739 --> 00:24:54,261
Where'd this water come from?!

299
00:24:55,347 --> 00:24:56,521
Whoa-whoa-whoa!

300
00:24:56,608 --> 00:24:57,347
Sanji-san!

301
00:24:57,782 --> 00:24:59,782
O-Somechwan!

302
00:25:03,869 --> 00:25:05,826
What is happening inside Onigashima?!

303
00:25:10,826 --> 00:25:13,217
The Flame Clouds are dispersing!

304
00:25:15,869 --> 00:25:19,434
No! Onigashima is plummeting!

305
00:25:26,957 --> 00:25:30,391
Come forth, Flame Clouds!

306
00:25:33,435 --> 00:25:35,086
Amazing!

307
00:25:35,086 --> 00:25:36,782
Spectacular work, Momonsuke-kun!

308
00:25:37,347 --> 00:25:39,130
Now, go!

309
00:25:39,217 --> 00:25:41,608
Aye-aye! Roger that!

310
00:25:46,565 --> 00:25:48,565
Go!

311
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:10,435
I will conquer Wano,
and then the world itself!

312
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:15,130
Now, what kind of world
do think you can create...
you

313
00:26:15,217 --> 00:26:17,478
...Straw Hat?!

314
00:26:35,478 --> 00:26:37,130
I'll make...

315
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:40,217
Luffy!

316
00:26:47,739 --> 00:26:50,391
A world where all my pals...

317
00:26:56,696 --> 00:26:58,652
...get to eat...

318
00:26:59,957 --> 00:27:01,826
...til they're full!

319
00:27:11,696 --> 00:27:13,782
Kaido!

320
00:28:12,478 --> 00:28:13,826
King.

321
00:28:13,826 --> 00:28:18,869
I know exactly who Joyboy is.

322
00:28:18,869 --> 00:28:19,869
Who is it?

323
00:28:21,130 --> 00:28:25,304
He's the man who'll defeat me someday!

324
00:28:26,782 --> 00:28:29,478
Guess he'll never show, then.

325
00:29:14,869 --> 00:29:17,565
"Time's up"

326
00:29:18,826 --> 00:29:22,348
Someone said again, with a laugh

327
00:29:22,782 --> 00:29:27,347
Fine then, hide-and-seek playtime...

328
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:28,913
...is over

329
00:29:30,913 --> 00:29:34,217
Let's go, come on (We can see it soon)

330
00:29:34,260 --> 00:29:38,086
Let your heart beat out

331
00:29:39,043 --> 00:29:42,303
and things will change (We can see it soon)

332
00:29:42,565 --> 00:29:46,608
Grow strong, you have time

333
00:29:46,696 --> 00:29:47,479
Lift up that dream

334
00:29:47,739 --> 00:29:54,565
The overflowing loneliness can't sustain me alone

335
00:29:54,652 --> 00:29:58,609
We were so free in our younger days

336
00:29:58,739 --> 00:30:02,000
What a dumb dream

337
00:30:02,217 --> 00:30:03,217
...to live

338
00:30:03,435 --> 00:30:07,087
Shining a light on uncharted ways

339
00:30:07,347 --> 00:30:11,217
Get on our feet and try

340
00:30:11,304 --> 00:30:15,217
Let's see the ends of the world together

341
00:30:15,347 --> 00:30:19,347
Together, we can go and fly